{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"mg-title","type":"text","x":-40,"y":-220,"width":1000,"height":150,"text":"# Management\n\nStarter view for team-shaped brains. Add one file node per real person/team under `14-people/` (duplicate `_templates/person.md` and `_templates/team.md`), then link them here — Company -> Team -> Person -> Client/Project/Meeting. Nothing about compensation, health, or private feedback belongs in `14-people/` — see `14-people/README.md`."},
